  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into 0.5cm-thick rounds.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with pepper and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the sweet potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e1cfcbf8f6928425d5c26b/step-01f0d300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice tomato into thin rounds.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a medium bowl, combine chermoula spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil. Add haloumi, turning to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e1cfcbf8f6928425d5c26b/step-62119210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove pan from heat, then add the honey and sprinkle half the everything garnish, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e1cfcbf8f6928425d5c26b/step-41e58920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e1cfcbf8f6928425d5c26b/step-197a4f30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a second medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e1cfcbf8f6928425d5c26b/step-9ea9b340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the tray with sweet potato rounds, sprinkle with remaining everything garnish, tossing to coat.\n• Spread burger bun bases with garlic sauce.\n• Top with haloumi, tomato and salad leaves.\n• Serve with seasoned sweet potato rounds. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e1cfcbf8f6928425d5c26b/step-52e8c250.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
